		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_568174730608300015">
		Everyone passing because AI	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_568174730608300015">
		You will never play or buy a game again. AI is the future. Within 5 years entire games will be 100% made, developed and voiced by AI. People are already not buying anything with AI used in any capacity. Okay, never buy or play a game past 2023 then.	</div>
		
