<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46329996","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"582809103434380736","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5186030\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5186030\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":5186030}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46329996\/General\/",
		"568174730608300015", {"author":"Fear57","text":"You will never play or buy a game again. AI is the future. Within 5 years entire games will be 100% made, developed and voiced by AI. People are already not buying anything with AI used in any capacity. Okay, never buy or play a game past 2023 then."}		);
			} );
</script>
										<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475851404_582809103434380736_568174730608300015", {"feature":"582809103434380736","feature2":"568174730608300015","owner":"103582791475851404","commentthreadid":"660065061","total_count":26,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":26797902,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"0\",\"forum_appid\":5186030,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"568174730608309201":{"text":"AI shillers be freaking hilarious they should do stand-up comedy lmao","author":"SoulKing"},"568174730608309463":{"text":"Fact buddy. Its here and its going nowhere. You are the person laughing at the clown on stage who is saying the building is on fire.","author":"Fear57"},"568174730608310796":{"text":"[quote=Fear57;568174730608309463]Fact buddy. Its here and its going nowhere. You are the person laughing at the clown on stage who is saying the building is on fire. [\/quote]\nSaying \"it is going nowhere\" is such a defeatist statement. Gamers have the power to choose what games they buy. If games developed with AI don't get any sales and \"regular\" games do then game developers will eventually stop using AI. In the end the consumer has the choice to vote with their wallet","author":"thomzen"},"568174730608310925":{"text":"[quote=Thomzen;568174730608310796][quote=Fear57;568174730608309463]Fact buddy. Its here and its going nowhere. You are the person laughing at the clown on stage who is saying the building is on fire. [\/quote]\nSaying \"it is going nowhere\" is such a defeatist statement. Gamers have the power to choose what games they buy. If games developed with AI don't get any sales and \"regular\" games do then game developers will eventually stop using AI. In the end the consumer has the choice to vote with their wallet [\/quote]\nDo you tell developers to code in 0s and 1s instead of programming languages that make it easier to program? Are they dumb because they don't do it the \"true\" way? The same reaction happened when we invented phonograph (canned music!), cameras (painting is the only true art!), electricity, internet, cars...\n\nIf humanity had waited for people like you to give them permission to innovate, the world would be so boring. Oh, and we'll all be dead by now without any technologies if we feared used them. All of them are dual use, we exploit the good, minimize the bad.\n\nAI coding and asset generation literally enables indie developers to do passion projects and what used to require millions of dollars and expensive dev teams. It literally democratizes art and access to infinite entertainment for everyone. You should be complaining about the low effort generic human slop that triple A companies do every year, instead of moaning about the golden age of gaming and modding that is coming thanks to new technologies.","author":"Raulikien"},"568174730608311150":{"text":"[quote=Raulikien;568174730608310925][quote=Thomzen;568174730608310796]\nSaying \"it is going nowhere\" is such a defeatist statement. Gamers have the power to choose what games they buy. If games developed with AI don't get any sales and \"regular\" games do then game developers will eventually stop using AI. In the end the consumer has the choice to vote with their wallet [\/quote]\nAI literally enables indie developers to do passion projects and what used to require millions of dollars and expensive dev teams. It literally democratizes art and access to infinite entertainment. You should be complaining about the low effort generic human slop that triple A companies do every year. [\/quote]\nThis is also true. Both statements can be true at the same time","author":"thomzen"},"568174730608335758":{"text":"If AI is the future why are you so upset?","author":"CatCatCatCatCat!!!!"},"568174939259017216":{"text":"I dont mind AI when its used for programming but it makes visuals look like shit","author":"Gilver"},"568174939259028300":{"text":"[quote=SoulKing;568174730608309201]AI shillers be freaking hilarious they should do stand-up comedy lmao [\/quote]\nAll the kids supporting AI were the same people supporting NFTs \u02d0lunar2019laughingpig\u02d0","author":"Zeruca"},"568174939259035509":{"text":"[quote=Fear57]You will never play or buy a game again. AI is the future. Within 5 years entire games will be 100% made, developed and voiced by AI. People are already not buying anything with AI used in any capacity. Okay, never buy or play a game past 2023 then. [\/quote]\nOkay.","author":"DrBrogbo"},"568174939259078798":{"text":"AI hate in ALL its forms is something we will have to get used to.\n\nRemember back in the day when people found out Carbs were bad and we had to advertise everything as low carb or carb free? Then we found out there were GOOD carbs so we went on to hate Trans Fats.\n\nRemember when we realized mouths were filled with germs and bacteria so mouthwash was advertised as killing 99.9% of all germs till we realized there were beneficial germs we were killing too so now its low or no alcohol in mouthwash.\n\nViolence in videogames is abhorant and disgusting according to late 80s early to mid 90s adults! Its the scourge of our youth! (before that it was gangs, before that it was drugs, before that it was rock and roll music) Then we learned to move on and hate profanity then anything sexual.\n\nDont pay it too much mind. AI is used to make \"slop\". But we must remember its a tool at the end of the day and has its uses. AI is the future. The world was in great turmoil when we lost generations of cultivating\/smithing knowledge when the industrial revolution came and eliminated those jobs. But we are all better off even if it did affect MANY families and regular people.\n\nPeople are making things with AI that NEVER would have been made without it. Mods, Videos, music! People without the know how on how to do these things are doing it with AI. Without those people these things wouldnt have been made. As an example people are making entire shows about for example the Malfoid trend. A real person a real artist, a real writer woudlnt have taken on that project since no one would have funded it. But some guy did it with the help of AI and its excellent.","author":"Ensign"},"568174939259089661":{"text":"I think it's great but I agree on the AI Art. A lot of it looks like slop that could be done a bit better. It all got that deep fry look that you get when you ask Chatgpt for multiple times to edit an image.","author":"Discop"},"568174939259096340":{"text":"AI is not a tool. It is a cancer. It's not used to make labors of love, it's used to make the mediocre think they're gifted. It's for lazy people who want to make a quick buck.","author":"Kildan24"},"568174939259096961":{"text":"[quote=Kildan24;568174939259096340]AI is not a tool. It is a cancer. It's not used to make labors of love, it's used to make the mediocre think they're gifted. It's for lazy people who want to make a quick buck. [\/quote]\n\nYou havent explored enough. There are many labors of love out here. Go play rimworld and you will find quite a few labor of love mods both quality of life and game changing from people like me who love the game but dont have the know how on how to make mods so they just \"vibe code\" thier own. Its not for profit, its for personal use and they share it with us incase anyone else wants to try it.\n\nAgain on youtube there are people trying to make money yes, but amoung the sea of greedy mediocre drama ai audio reads and lazy history videos there is actual entertainment being made music that would never have been made, animations that never would have been made. It is absolutely a tool.","author":"Ensign"},"568174939259099282":{"text":"Gameplay is all that matters.","author":"Geist"},"568174939259293164":{"text":"[quote=Fear57]You will never play or buy a game again. AI is the future. Within 5 years entire games will be 100% made, developed and voiced by AI. People are already not buying anything with AI used in any capacity. Okay, never buy or play a game past 2023 then. [\/quote]\nActually fun thing about free will, we can all choose for ourselves how much is too much AI or too little AI. In this case the game suffers because the music quality is terrible and you can hear how it breaks down. The cinematics suffer because the two second cuts show us that they couldn't even pay for a premium video making AI account. \n\nWhen we really can't tell, then much less people will care. But while its this obvious, no one wants to engage in media that doesn't have a soul. \n\nWe all reserve the right to feel differently about it later.","author":"RamblyBear"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
