			<div class="forum_comment_action_menu" style="display: none;" id="forum_comment_actions_menu_568174939259078798">				<a class="forum_comment_action report tooltip" href="javascript:Forum_ShowReportDialog( '103582791475851404', '582809103434380736', '568174730608300015', '27153654', '568174939259078798' );" data-tooltip-text="Report this post for inappropriate content.  Reported post are flagged for review by moderators.">
				<span class="non_breaking_space">&nbsp;</span><img src="https://community.akamai.steamstatic.com/public/images/skin_1/notification_icon_flag_dark.png?v=1">Report this post</a>
			</div>
							</div>
			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_568174939259078798">
				AI hate in ALL its forms is something we will have to get used to.<br><br>Remember back in the day when people found out Carbs were bad and we had to advertise everything as low carb or carb free? Then we found out there were GOOD carbs so we went on to hate Trans Fats.<br><br>Remember when we realized mouths were filled with germs and bacteria so mouthwash was advertised as killing 99.9% of all germs till we realized there were beneficial germs we were killing too so now its low or no alcohol in mouthwash.<br><br>Violence in videogames is abhorant and disgusting according to late 80s early to mid 90s adults! Its the scourge of our youth! (before that it was gangs, before that it was drugs, before that it was rock and roll music) Then we learned to move on and hate profanity then anything sexual.<br><br>Dont pay it too much mind. AI is used to make &quot;slop&quot;. But we must remember its a tool at the end of the day and has its uses. AI is the future. The world was in great turmoil when we lost generations of cultivating/smithing knowledge when the industrial revolution came and eliminated those jobs. But we are all better off even if it did affect MANY families and regular people.<br><br>People are making things with AI that NEVER would have been made without it. Mods, Videos, music! People without the know how on how to do these things are doing it with AI. Without those people these things wouldnt have been made. As an example people are making entire shows about for example the Malfoid trend. A real person a real artist, a real writer woudlnt have taken on that project since no one would have funded it. But some guy did it with the help of AI and its excellent.			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
