			</div>
							</div>
			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_568174939259096961">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b><a href="#c568174939259096340">Kildan24</a></b>:</div>AI is not a tool. It is a cancer. It's not used to make labors of love, it's used to make the mediocre think they're gifted. It's for lazy people who want to make a quick buck. </blockquote><br>You havent explored enough. There are many labors of love out here. Go play rimworld and you will find quite a few labor of love mods both quality of life and game changing from people like me who love the game but dont have the know how on how to make mods so they just &quot;vibe code&quot; thier own. Its not for profit, its for personal use and they share it with us incase anyone else wants to try it.<br><br>Again on youtube there are people trying to make money yes, but amoung the sea of greedy mediocre drama ai audio reads and lazy history videos there is actual entertainment being made music that would never have been made, animations that never would have been made. It is absolutely a tool.			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
									<div></div>
				
				
