				</div>

				
				<div class="commentthread_comment_actions" >
														<a class="forum_comment_action forum_comment_action_trigger" data-tooltip-type="selector" data-tooltip-content="#forum_comment_actions_menu_568174939259293164">
					<span><i class="ico16 arrow_down"></i></span>
				</a>
			
			<div class="forum_comment_action_menu" style="display: none;" id="forum_comment_actions_menu_568174939259293164">				<a class="forum_comment_action report tooltip" href="javascript:Forum_ShowReportDialog( '103582791475851404', '582809103434380736', '568174730608300015', '113560296', '568174939259293164' );" data-tooltip-text="Report this post for inappropriate content.  Reported post are flagged for review by moderators.">
				<span class="non_breaking_space">&nbsp;</span><img src="https://community.akamai.steamstatic.com/public/images/skin_1/notification_icon_flag_dark.png?v=1">Report this post</a>
			</div>
							</div>
			</div>
			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_568174939259293164">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b>Fear57</b>:</div>You will never play or buy a game again. AI is the future. Within 5 years entire games will be 100% made, developed and voiced by AI. People are already not buying anything with AI used in any capacity. Okay, never buy or play a game past 2023 then. </blockquote>Actually fun thing about free will, we can all choose for ourselves how much is too much AI or too little AI. In this case the game suffers because the music quality is terrible and you can hear how it breaks down. The cinematics suffer because the two second cuts show us that they couldn't even pay for a premium video making AI account. <br><br>When we really can't tell, then much less people will care. But while its this obvious, no one wants to engage in media that doesn't have a soul. <br><br>We all reserve the right to feel differently about it later.			</div>
			<div class="comment_footer_ctn">
									<div></div>
				
				
									<div class="forum_comment_permlink">
						<span class="forum_comment_moderate">
													</span>
